<!--
    Notification small icon for an active dictation session: the White Noise
    mark from ic_stat_whitenoise (same geometry, scaled down and vertically
    centred like the message icon, so both sit at the same height in the
    status bar) with a microphone on the right, so dictation reads as White
    Noise but differs from the message icon. The clip path cuts a gap around
    the microphone out of the mark; its outer square and inner outline wind
    in opposite directions so the nonzero clip excludes the outline. Must
    stay alpha-only white: the system tints small icons itself.
-->
